                                "sense_id": "4cb1c14d-4f54-3ae8-b7a5-93185e62c389",
                                "text": "As the General straightened his tall, slight form, his tobacco-lighting accomplished, Duff Green, breathing pursily from a dash of trepidation, could not forbear comment."
