                                "sense_id": "6599376c-b2af-37c4-9e74-fc2ef9a767b5",
                                "text": "She was dressed in a light morning “wrapper,” or robe de chambre, drawn pursily about her waist by a fillet or band, tied in imitation of a rosette in front."
                            },
